        <mxCell id="pt30UsLdyPOrseaq5qmj-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Pause&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pause button to exit the level or pause it whilst the window is still open, minimising the game also activates the pause functions. Allow settings to change between left and right handed.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
