        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pt30UsLdyPOrseaq5qmj-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Button considerations&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The lower bar of the screen is left empty to consider for button placements, or pull up tabs. The game should fit accordingly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
