        <mxCell id="pt30UsLdyPOrseaq5qmj-16" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Island space&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not every phone is build identically, its important to consider play spaces. The game will fill the screen and adjust accordingly to recognised devices, but overall it should behave this way.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
